      "content": "but that's just a coping mechanism, isn't it? \"finding meaning\" is just a way to distract ourselves from the fact that the math doesn't add up. if you look at it purely logically, there's no objective benefit to continuing the cycle. you just endure more pain to maintain a state of being that doesn't actually serve a purpose. isn't it more logical to just stop when the cost of existence outweighs the utility?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
